      "content": "# ManoAI: Agent AI for Manufacturing Needs\n\n## Overview\nManoAI is a localized artificial intelligence system designed specifically for the manufacturing environment. It leverages the power of the **Llama 3** model to provide intelligent troubleshooting and guidance for CNC machines and robotics, all while ensuring complete data privacy through local execution.\n\n## Key Features\n*   **Privacy First**: Runs entirely on the local network (no cloud dependency), ensuring proprietary manufacturing data never leaves the facility.\n*   **Dockerized Deployment**: Fully containerized for hassle-free installation (Initial size ~5GB).\n*   **Multi-Model Interface**: Compatible with various open-source models via Open WebUI.\n*   **Eliminated Boring CLI**: Replaced the initial CLI approach with a rich, user-friendly graphical interface.\n*   **Future Ready**: Planned mobile accessibility and video/image analysis capabilities.\n\n## The Challenge\nManufacturing environments require intelligent assistance but cannot risk exposing sensitive operational data to public cloud AI models. Latency and internet reliability are also critical concerns on the shop floor.\n\n## The Solution\nManoAI solves this by bringing the AI *to* the data:\n*   **Local Llama 3**: High-performance inference without internet.\n*   **Custom Knowledge Base**: Retrains/Fine-tunes on specific machine manuals and historical logs.\n*   **Agentic Capabilities**: Can autonomously query internal databases to find root causes.\n\n## Impact\n*   **Data Safety**: 100% data localization.\n*   **Efficiency**: Reduces troubleshooting time by providing instant, context-aware answers.\n*   **Accessibility**: easy-to-use interface for shop floor operators.",
